{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 76394, "name": "Copr user", "username": "coprserver", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/coprserver/{size}/21344_2.png", "created_at": "2022-12-20T15:21:08.744Z", "cooked": "<div><div class=\"col-sm-8 col-md-9\">\n    <h3>Description</h3>\n    <p></p>\n<p>total rewrite of yum extender using python-3-11, gtk4 &amp; libadwaita</p>\n    \n    <h3>Installation Instructions</h3>\n    <p>Instructions not filled in by author.\n             Author knows what to do.\n             Everybody else should avoid this repo.\n    </p>\n    <h3>Active Releases</h3>\n    <p>\n        The following unofficial repositories are provided as-is\n        by owner of this project.\n        Contact the owner directly for bugs or issues (IE: not bugzilla).\n    </p>\n    \n    <p class=\"text-muted\"> * Total number of packages downloaded in the last seven days.</p>\n    <p></p>\n    \n  </div></div>\n<hr>\n<small>This is a companion discussion topic for the original entry at <a href=\"https://copr.fedorainfracloud.org/coprs/timlau/yumex-ng/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://copr.fedorainfracloud.org/coprs/timlau/yumex-ng/</a></small>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2022-12-20T15:21:08.744Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 598, "reads": 14, "readers_count": 13, "score": 2992.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 45038, "topic_slug": "timlau-yumex-ng", "display_username": "Copr user", "primary_group_name": "discussion-bots", "flair_name": "discussion-bots", "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 52, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://copr.fedorainfracloud.org/coprs/timlau/yumex-ng/", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "clicks": 52}], "read": true, "user_title": "A product of MomCorp™", "title_is_group": true, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 969, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/timlau-yumex-ng/45038/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 80483, "name": "Der Linows", "username": "linows83", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/linows83/{size}/7581_2.png", "created_at": "2023-02-23T03:11:25.786Z", "cooked": "<p>THX for your work on yumex again , nice artwork , and it runs really great . I can use it with a Touchscreen on a Tablet too .</p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2023-02-23T03:11:25.786Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 3, "reads": 12, "readers_count": 11, "score": 17.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 45038, "topic_slug": "timlau-yumex-ng", "display_username": "Der Linows", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 4862, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 0, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/timlau-yumex-ng/45038/2", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 282742, "name": "Diego Humanes", "username": "wyup", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/wyup/{size}/34455_2.png", "created_at": "2024-03-14T14:33:08.833Z", "cooked": "<p>Thanks for keeping this software alive.<br>\nCould you build yumex-dnf5 for rawhide 41? It doesn’t seem to be available.</p>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2024-03-14T14:33:08.833Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 3, "reads": 11, "readers_count": 10, "score": 22.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 45038, "topic_slug": "timlau-yumex-ng", "display_username": "Diego Humanes", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 18889, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/timlau-yumex-ng/45038/3", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 290632, "name": "Tim Lauridsen", "username": "timlau", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/timlau/{size}/3201_2.png", "created_at": "2024-04-09T09:18:15.104Z", "cooked": "<p>There is only an DNF5 version in Rawhide, so “dnf install yumex” will install that</p>\n<p>I have updated the description on the Copr page to reflect that.</p>\n<p>/Tim</p>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2024-04-09T09:18:15.104Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 3, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 5, "reads": 9, "readers_count": 8, "score": 26.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 45038, "topic_slug": "timlau-yumex-ng", "display_username": "Tim Lauridsen", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Packaging Team", "title_is_group": false, "reply_to_user": {"id": 18889, "username": "wyup", "name": "Diego Humanes", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/wyup/{size}/34455_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 2774, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/timlau-yumex-ng/45038/4", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 290718, "name": "Diego Humanes", "username": "wyup", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/wyup/{size}/34455_2.png", "created_at": "2024-04-09T14:04:48.247Z", "cooked": "<p>Hi Tim, for some time or since some system updates, I got the following error when starting yumex. I’ve re-installed latest version from copr. It mentions flatpak, I removed flatpak from Fedora:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-plaintext\">$ sudo yumex\n16:02:39 DEBUG : (yumex) -  Version:  4.99.4-git20240409 (DNF5)\n16:02:39 DEBUG : (yumex) -  executable : /usr/bin/yumex\n16:02:39 DEBUG : (yumex) -  commmand-line : Namespace(debug=False, exit=False)\n\n(yumex:3895): Gtk-WARNING **: 16:02:39.225: Unable to acquire session bus: Falló al ejecutar el proceso hijo «dbus-launch» (No existe el fichero o el directorio)\n16:02:39 CRITICAL: (yumex) -  Uncaught exception: 'XDG_DATA_DIRS'\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/yumex/main.py\", line 59, in do_activate\n    self.win = YumexMainWindow(\n               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/yumex/ui/window.py\", line 78, in __init__\n    self.setup_gui()\n  File \"/usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/yumex/ui/window.py\", line 106, in setup_gui\n    self.setup_flatpaks()\n  File \"/usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/yumex/ui/window.py\", line 109, in setup_flatpaks\n    self.flatpak_view = YumexFlatpakView(self.presenter)\n                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/yumex/ui/flatpak_view.py\", line 41, in __init__\n    self.icons_paths = self.get_icon_paths()\n                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/yumex/ui/flatpak_view.py\", line 68, in get_icon_paths\n    return [f\"{path}/icons/\" for path in os.environ[\"XDG_DATA_DIRS\"].split(\":\")]\n                                         ~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"&lt;frozen os&gt;\", line 685, in __getitem__\nKeyError: 'XDG_DATA_DIRS'\n16:02:39 DEBUG : (yumex) -  traceback written to /root/.local/share/yumex/traceback_04-09-2024_160239.txt\nAdwaita-Message: 16:02:39.336: AdwMessageDialog mapped without a transient parent. This is discouraged.\n16:02:39 DEBUG : (yumex) -  search changed :\n</code></pre>\n<p>thanks</p>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2024-04-09T14:05:46.555Z", "reply_count": 2, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 3, "reads": 9, "readers_count": 8, "score": 26.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 45038, "topic_slug": "timlau-yumex-ng", "display_username": "Diego Humanes", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 18889, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/timlau-yumex-ng/45038/5", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 290834, "name": "Tim Lauridsen", "username": "timlau", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/timlau/{size}/3201_2.png", "created_at": "2024-04-09T17:43:23.477Z", "cooked": "<p>Look like the XDG_DATA_DIRS environment variable is not definded.</p>\n<p>It is set by default in Gnome, but might not be set in other DE.</p>\n<p>try installing the<br>\nxdg-user-dirs<br>\nxdg-user-dirs-gtk</p>\n<p>packages to see if it helps</p>", "post_number": 6, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2024-04-09T17:43:23.477Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 5, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 10, "reads": 9, "readers_count": 8, "score": 51.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 45038, "topic_slug": "timlau-yumex-ng", "display_username": "Tim Lauridsen", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Packaging Team", "title_is_group": false, "reply_to_user": {"id": 18889, "username": "wyup", "name": "Diego Humanes", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/wyup/{size}/34455_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 2774, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/timlau-yumex-ng/45038/6", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 290835, "name": "Tim Lauridsen", "username": "timlau", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/timlau/{size}/3201_2.png", "created_at": "2024-04-09T17:47:52.848Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"wyup\" data-post=\"5\" data-topic=\"45038\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/wyup/48/34455_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Diego Humanes:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It mentions flatpak, I removed flatpak from Fedora:</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>yumex-ng need flatpak to work, it has support for maintaining  flatpaks</p>", "post_number": 7, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2024-04-09T17:47:52.848Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 5, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 1, "reads": 9, "readers_count": 8, "score": 6.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 45038, "topic_slug": "timlau-yumex-ng", "display_username": "Tim Lauridsen", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Packaging Team", "title_is_group": false, "reply_to_user": {"id": 18889, "username": "wyup", "name": "Diego Humanes", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/wyup/{size}/34455_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 2774, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/timlau-yumex-ng/45038/7", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 291083, "name": "Diego Humanes", "username": "wyup", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/wyup/{size}/34455_2.png", "created_at": "2024-04-10T13:16:19.826Z", "cooked": "<p>Thanks, I had both xdg packages installed already. Apart from flatpak, I removed some unused xorg packages because I’m using wayland and wished to strip xorg as much as possible, without afecting the gnome and apps.</p>\n<p>I can run dnf-dragora okay, for comparison.</p>\n<p>I’ve always been an admirer of yumex since the beginning, such a great piece of software. I find it had better functionality back then, you could browse through packages and navigate dependencies, files… it had a great UI. With later versions it became stripped out and now it only has basic functionality. I find it breaks recently with commits sometimes.</p>\n<p>I wished it gained advanced funcionality such as navigating packages as hypertext, and specially advanced dnf5 commands such as repoquery whatconflicts, whatprovides, provides for a file or command.</p>\n<p>dnfdragora used to be a ‘drag’ <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/smile.png?v=12\" title=\":smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> but now it works as yumex did before.</p>\n<p>Just like to thumbs up your work and commend you for how good it was, always wondered why it wasn’t default in fedora. Thanks for maintaining yumex.</p>", "post_number": 8, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2024-04-10T13:16:19.826Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 17, "reads": 9, "readers_count": 8, "score": 86.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 45038, "topic_slug": "timlau-yumex-ng", "display_username": "Diego Humanes", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 18889, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/timlau-yumex-ng/45038/8", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 350364, "name": "Matthias", "username": "salutatio", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/294172/{size}.png", "created_at": "2024-10-20T07:15:31.203Z", "cooked": "<p>I can’t install yumex…</p>\n<p>I have added the copr repo:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>sudo dnf copr enable timlau/yumex-ng</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>That also worked. However, I cannot install the package with dnf:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>sudo dnf install yumex<br>\nUpdating and loading repositories:<br>\nRepositories loaded.<br>\nFailed to resolve the transaction:<br>\nNo match for argument: yumex<br>\nYou can try to add to command line:<br>\n–skip-unavailable to skip unavailable packages</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>The same happens with</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>sudo dnf install yumex-ng</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I am on Fedora 41 (beta). Is this perhaps the cause of the problem?</p>\n<p>Any suggestions?</p>\n<p>Thanks a lot</p>", "post_number": 9, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2024-10-20T07:15:31.203Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 58, "reads": 8, "readers_count": 7, "score": 296.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 45038, "topic_slug": "timlau-yumex-ng", "display_username": "Matthias", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 22977, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 0, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/timlau-yumex-ng/45038/9", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 350369, "name": "Tim Lauridsen", "username": "timlau", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/timlau/{size}/3201_2.png", "created_at": "2024-10-20T08:29:37.363Z", "cooked": "<p>You have to use</p>\n<p>sudo dnf install yumex-dnf5</p>", "post_number": 10, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2024-10-20T08:29:37.363Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 9, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 4, "reads": 8, "readers_count": 7, "score": 21.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 45038, "topic_slug": "timlau-yumex-ng", "display_username": "Tim Lauridsen", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Packaging Team", "title_is_group": false, "reply_to_user": {"id": 22977, "username": "salutatio", "name": "Matthias", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/294172/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 2774, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/timlau-yumex-ng/45038/10", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 350371, "name": "Matthias", "username": "salutatio", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/294172/{size}.png", "created_at": "2024-10-20T08:38:15.512Z", "cooked": "<p>Same error with</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>sudo dnf install yumex-dnf5</p>\n</blockquote>", "post_number": 11, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2024-10-20T08:38:15.512Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 4, "reads": 9, "readers_count": 8, "score": 21.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 45038, "topic_slug": "timlau-yumex-ng", "display_username": "Matthias", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 22977, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 0, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/timlau-yumex-ng/45038/11", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 352813, "name": "Matthias", "username": "salutatio", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/294172/{size}.png", "created_at": "2024-10-29T17:08:57.266Z", "cooked": "<p>I have now tested it on other machines:<br>\nThe installation on Fedora 40 works, the installation on Fedora 41 (as of today no longer a beta) does not work (neither ‘yumex-dnf5’ nor ‘yumex’). Error message is the same everywhere, as already written above.</p>", "post_number": 12, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2024-10-29T17:08:57.266Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 11, "reads": 9, "readers_count": 8, "score": 56.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 45038, "topic_slug": "timlau-yumex-ng", "display_username": "Matthias", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 22977, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 0, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/timlau-yumex-ng/45038/12", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 353607, "name": "Tim Lauridsen", "username": "timlau", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/timlau/{size}/3201_2.png", "created_at": "2024-10-30T17:03:31.510Z", "cooked": "<p>My fault there is no stable release builds for Fedora 41</p>\n<p>But there is dev builds here in the yumex-ng-dev copr.<br>\n<a href=\"https://copr.fedorainfracloud.org/coprs/timlau/yumex-ng-dev/\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://copr.fedorainfracloud.org/coprs/timlau/yumex-ng-dev/</a></p>\n<p>When I make a stable release next time, there will be a Fedora 41 build.</p>", "post_number": 13, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2024-10-30T17:03:31.510Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 11, "reads": 8, "readers_count": 7, "score": 61.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 45038, "topic_slug": "timlau-yumex-ng", "display_username": "Tim Lauridsen", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_i